  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UA - ALCHEVSK STEEL MILL REVAMPING AND MODERNIZATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;(i)	      generate and sell greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reductions (ERs) and transfer ERs as Emission Reduction Units (ERUs) to buyers under Joint Implementation (JI) mechanism by modernization of the steel making capacity in OJSC &#x201c;Alchevsk Iron and Steel Works&#x201d; (AISW);(ii)	support investment in technology modernization that improves process, energy efficiency and environmental performancethrough significant reductions in local air emissions, wastewater discharges and solid waste generation/disposal. &quot;</narrative>
  </description>
